  "arrangerNotes": "Chorus only (the verse has a chromatic A♮), vocal line, verified against the Wikisource LilyPond transcription of the 1918 Feist sheet music; the chorus repeat with first and second endings is written out and the score's rest is kept. The stutters ('K-K-K-', 'g-g-g-', 'm-m-m-', 'k-k-k-') are eighth-note triplets: each triplet note is 1/3 beat (dur 0.333…). The 'adore' note is tied into the first triplet note (2 + 1/3 beats). No simplification needed. Range 1 to high 1. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
  "verified": true
}
